; GraphEdit with its arrange button hidden. It is the last widget in the toolbar row
; (graph_edit.cpp:3316-3323), so hiding it is the only case that shortens the panel without
; moving another widget: a regression in how the row width derives from its visible children
; shows here and nowhere else.

; Every fixture in this family shares one GraphEdit rect and one GraphNode, and only
; unit-graph-edit-scroll-offset-clamped.tscn authors `scroll_offset`: `set_scroll_offset` clamps
; against bounds no child has widened while properties apply (graph_edit.cpp:407), so an authored
; offset moves the grid, the nodes and the minimap camera together and masks the one variable.

